Test a world point against the geometry\&. Ignores enabled/sensor flags and category/mask/group filters\&. Nonfinite coordinates throw\&.

.PP
\fBParameters\fP
.RS 4
\fIworldPoint\fP \fBPoint\fP in owning-layer/world coordinates\&.
.RE
.PP
