.SS "boolean removeShape (uint id)"

.PP
Remove one shape by its stable ID\&. IDs are never reassigned within a collider\&. Removing an added shape ends its contacts at the next update\&. Source-controlled frame/animation shapes cannot be removed individually; attempting that throws\&. Removing an addition leaves the source active\&.

.PP
\fBParameters\fP
