.SS "\fBCollider\fP setCollisionFilter (function callback)"

.PP
Filter contacts independently of owner type\&. The predicate receives this \fBCollider\fP and the other \fBCollider\fP and must return a boolean\&. Returning false suppresses response and contact notifications\&. It can run multiple times during a step; keep it a read-only decision\&. Geometric \fBcontains()\fP/overlaps() queries ignore it\&. Exceptions reject the pair and are recorded by \fBgetContactError()\fP\&. Pass null to clear the callback\&. Owner detachment clears callbacks\&. See \fBcollider_geometry_sources\fP\&.

.PP
\fBParameters\fP
.RS 4
\fIcallback\fP Callback to install, or null to clear it\&.
.RE
.PP
\fBReturns\fP
.RS 4
This \fBCollider\fP for chaining\&. 
.RE
.PP

.SS "\fBCollider\fP setCollisionMask (uint value)"

.PP
Set the categories this collider accepts\&. A zero mask suppresses contacts\&. Both endpoints’ masks must accept the other category\&.

.PP
\fBParameters\fP
.RS 4
\fIvalue\fP Unsigned 32-bit bitset\&. Default accepts all categories\&.
