.SS "const \fBCollider\fP NoCollider\fR [static]\fP"

.PP
Shared absence object for every \fBSprite\fP or \fBPart\fP without collision geometry\&. Compare by identity\&. Mutators safely do nothing, with a debug diagnostic; they do not accumulate settings for later creation\&. Its geometry is empty\&. 

